body:
The bug is caused by the following code:

https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/ce40e85cbbf100df3e5507d26e961582ffdd1a17/tools/gulp-tasks/cldr/extract.js#L447-L453

There should be an `else` clause for `currencyDecimal` to push an `undefined` value to hold this position, like:

```typescript
if (symbols.currencyDecimal) {
  symbolValues.push(symbols.currencyDecimal);
} else {
  symbolValues.push(undefined);
}
```

Otherwise `currencyDecimal` and `currencyGroup` would be mixed up.

I guess a PR would be welcomed.

Also CC: @ocombe
